## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

Cardamom Velvet stretches the cool cardamom recognizer through linalool and linalyl acetate into literal cedar and a yielding Ebanol seam. Sandalore remains the fresh-light structural sandalwood; Ebanol supplies a distinct creamy-soft texture, not an extra musk. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LN-03.json`.

